# DIAGNOSTICS

`CROI_ERR_BAD_HANDLE`, `CROI_ERR_WRONG_TYPE` and `CROI_ERR_ACCESS_DENIED` as for any handle; see syscall(2).
`CROI_ERR_NO_MEMORY`: no memory for the pages, or an account's limit.
`CROI_ERR_INVALID_ARGS`: a bad option, or an unwritable <out>.

